#* {{quote-book|ca|year=1965|author=Sebastià Juan Arbó|title=Narracions del Delta|text=Se sentia el soroll intermitent de la campaneta, que ho dominava tot, i '''a banda i banda''', tot al llarg dels carrers, centenars de llumenetes tremolaven a dalt de les portes, i en finestres i balcons.|t=The intermittent sound of the handbell, which dominated everything, was heard and, all along the streets '''on both sides''', hundreds of small lights trembled above the doorways, in windows, and on balconies.}}

