Page 4404 cadascun: Found match for regex: =
Page 4404 cadascun: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology===
{{inh+|ca|VL.|*cascunum}} or {{m|la|*casquunum}}, a conflation of {{inh|ca|la|[[quisque]] [[ūnum]]|t=each one}} and {{m|la||*catunum}}, from {{m|la|cata}} (<{{der|ca|grc|κατά}}) {{m|la|ūnum}}. Or from a crossing of {{m|ca|cada}} and {{inh|ca|roa-oca|quiscun}}. Compare {{cog|oc|cadun}}, {{m|oc|cascun}}~{{m|oc|chascun}}, {{cog|fr|chacun}}, {{cog|it|ciascuno}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ca-IPA}}
* {{rhymes|ca|un|s=3}}

===Determiner===
{{ca-det}}

# {{lb|ca|~ {{l|ca|de}}}} [[each]] [[one]] (of)
#: {{syn|ca|cada un}}
#: {{ux|ca|'''Cadascuna''' de les tres noies van rebre un premi.|'''Each''' of the three girls got a prize.}}

====Usage notes====
The plural forms are used with [[pluralia tantum]], which are grammatically plural but are still single objects.

====Related terms====
* {{l|ca|cadascú}}

===References===
* {{R:ca:DCVB|cadascú}}
-------- end text --------
