===Pronunciation===
* {{ca-IPA|ó}}
* {{rhymes|ca|oɾa}}

===Noun===
{{ca-noun|f}}

# [[flask]], [[canteen]] {{gloss|water bottle}}
#* {{quote-book|ca|year=1998|author=Júlia Costa|title=Rondalla del camí|publisher=Universitat autònoma de Barcelona|page=83|passage=Dai descavalcà, s'arrecerà sota una alzina polsosa, i va beure una mica d'aigua de la '''cantimplora''', amb cura de no excedir-se.|translation=Dai dismounted his horse, and took shelter under a dusty oak, and he drank a bit of water from his '''canteen''', taking care not to drink too much.}}
#* {{RQ:Sanchez Pell freda|chapter=5|passage=Va treure una petita '''cantimplora''' de ferro i en va fer un glop. No me la va oferir: {{...}}|translation=He produced a small iron '''flask''' and took a sip from it. He didn't offer it to me: {{...}}}}

