{{inh+|ca|la|cauliculus}}, diminutive of {{m|la|caulis||cabbage}}. The spelling reflects a dialectal plural form with [[ieisme]] [[reanalysis|reanalysed]] as a singular. In other varieties, the plural was [[dissimilation|dissimilated]] to {{m|ca|conills}} or [[affrication|affricated]] to {{m|ca|colitx}}.

====Noun====
{{ca-noun|m|colissos}}

# {{lb|ca|usually|in the plural}} [[bladder campion]]
#: {{syn|ca|colitx|morró}}

=====Derived terms=====
* {{l|ca|colitx}}

===Etymology 2===
{{bor+|ca|fr|coulisse}}.

====Noun====
{{ca-noun|m|colissos}}

# [[coulisse]], [[slide]]
#: {{syn|ca|colissa}}

===Further reading===
