===Pronoun===
{{head|ca|pronoun|cat2=interrogative pronouns}}

# {{lb|ca|Algherese|Italianism}} [[what]] {{gloss|interrogative}}
#: {{uxi|ca|'''Cosa''' voleu?|'''What''' do you want?}}

====Usage notes====
The Italianism ''cosa?'' ('what?') is found within Algherese and is commonly used by speakers thereof, but is deemed by the IEC as something to be avoided.

