{{ca-noun|m|f=#a}}

# [[Croat]] {{gloss|an inhabitant of Croatia or an ethnic Croat}}

=====Related terms=====
* {{l|ca|Croàcia|gloss=Croatia}}

====Noun====
{{ca-noun|m|-}}

# [[Croatian]] {{gloss|a Slavic language of the Balkans}}
#: {{syn|ca|serbocroat}}

===Further reading===
* {{R:ca:IEC2}}
* {{R:ca:GDLC}}
* {{R:ca:DNV}}
