===Etymology===
{{inh+|ca|roa-oca|leixar}}, from {{der|ca|la|laxō|laxāre}} (compare {{cog|oc|daissar}} and {{m|oc|laissar}}, {{cog|pt|deixar}}, {{cog|an|deixar}}, {{cog|es|dejar}}, {{cog|fr|laisser}} and {{cog|it|lasciare}}). The alteration of the initial ''l-'' to ''d-'' (found in Ibero- and Occitano-Romance) may be due to the preposition {{m|ca|de}} preceding it in many constructions using this verb, or from contraction of a {{cog|LL.||*dēlaxāre}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ca-IPA}}
* {{audio|ca|LL-Q7026 (cat)-Unjoanqualsevol-deixar.wav|Audio}}

===Verb===
{{ca-verb}}

# {{lb|ca|transitive}} to [[leave]] {{gloss|to refrain from taking (something) away}}
# {{lb|ca|reflexive}} to [[let oneself go]] {{gloss|to cease to care about one's appearance}}
# {{lb|ca|transitive}} to [[leave]] {{gloss|to put; to place}}
#: {{syn|ca|posar|col·locar}}
#: {{uxi|ca|va '''deixar''' les cartes a la taula|she '''left''' the letters on the table}}
# to [[leave]] {{gloss|to cause, to result in}}
#: {{uxi|ca|la seva confessió ens va '''deixar''' sense paraules|his confession '''left''' us speechless}}
# {{lb|ca|transitive}} to [[let]], to [[allow]], to [[permit]]
#: {{syn|ca|permetre}}
#: {{uxi|ca|'''deixar''' caure|to drop|lit=to allow to fall}}
# {{lb|ca|transitive}} to [[leave]], to [[depart]] from
#* {{quote-journal|ca|journal=Ara|date=Nov 8 2020|title=El trumpisme arrela malgrat la derrota de Trump|author=Núria Ferragutcasas
|passage=El seu populisme i la seva demagògia han mobilitzat clarament els votants republicans i, per això, encara que '''deixi''' la Casa Blanca, el Partit Republicà continuarà sent el Partit de Trump.
|t=His populism and his demagogy have clearly mobilized Republican voters and so, even if he '''leaves''' the White House, the Republican Party will keep being the Party of Trump.
|url=https://www.ara.cat/internacional/eleccions-estats-units-2020-donald-trump-joe-biden_0_2559944078.html}}
# {{lb|ca|transitive}} to [[leave behind]], to [[abandon]]
# {{lb|ca|transitive}} to [[leave]] to {{gloss|to transfer possession of after death}}
# {{lb|ca|transitive}} to [[lend]]
#: {{syn|ca|prestar}}
#: {{uxi|ca|'''Deixa'm''' el mòbil, he de trucar la Gina.|'''Let me borrow''' your phone, I have to call Gina.}}

