Page 8205 desitjar: Found match for regex: =
Page 8205 desitjar: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology===
From the noun {{m|ca|desig}}; cf. Latin {{m|la|desidero|dēsīderō, dēsīderāre|long for, desire, feel the want of, miss, regret}}. Possibly corresponds to a {{inh|ca|VL.|-}} verb {{m|la||*dēsidiāre}}, itself perhaps a crossing between {{inh|ca|la|dēsīderāre}} and {{m|la||invidiāre}}, from {{m|la|invidia}}. Compare {{cog|oc|desirar}} and {{cog|pt|desejar}}, {{cog|es|desear}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ca-IPA}}
* {{rhymes|ca|a(ɾ)|s=3}}

===Verb===
{{ca-verb}}

# {{lb|ca|transitive}} to [[wish]] for, [[desire]], [[want]]
#: {{syn|ca|desirar}}

====Conjugation====
{{ca-conj-ar|desitj}}

====Related terms====
* {{l|ca|desig}}
-------- end text --------
