Page 9844 enllà: Found match for regex: =
Page 9844 enllà: -------- begin text --------

===Pronunciation===
* {{ca-IPA}}

===Adverb===
{{ca-adv}}

# [[further]]
# [[beyond]]
# [[over]]
#: ''Fes-te '''enllà'''.''
#:: Move '''over'''
# [[before]]
#: ''D'ahir '''enllà'''.''
#:: '''Before''' yesterday
# [[from]]
#: ''De demà '''enllà'''.''
#:: '''From''' tomorrow

====Usage notes====
* ''Enllà'' refers to the direction of any given action. It is most commonly used in the construction {{m|ca|més enllà||further, beyond}}.
*: ''No eren '''més enllà''' de dotze.''
*:: They didn't go '''beyond''' twelve.

====Derived terms====
* {{l|ca|ençà i enllà}}
* {{l|ca|més enllà}}

