# {{lb|ca|colloquial}} to [[hurl]], to [[fling]]
#* {{quote-book|ca|year=2013|author=Joan Turull|title=La vida d'un ignorant|publisher=MARGE BOOKS|isbn=9788415340911|page=95
|passage=No tolerava ni un sol error: si un pastís —un de sol— o tot un carro no eren prou bons, els '''estampava''' contra la paret i tornava a començar.
|t=I wouldn't tolerate even a single mistake: if a cake — even just one — or a whole batch wasn't good enough, I would '''fling''' them against the wall and start over.}}
# {{lb|ca|colloquial|reflexive|estampar-se}} to [[crash]] (into)
#* {{quote-journal|ca|year=|date=December 2016|author=|title=Quatre fugitius s'estampen amb un cotxe al carrer de Balmes|work=El Periódico|url=http://www.elperiodico.cat/ca/noticias/barcelona/quatre-fugitius-estampen-cotxe-carrer-balmes-barcelona-5694390
