# {{n-g|replaces an independent clause (one which could grammatically form a sentence on its own)}}
# {{n-g|replaces an adjective or an indefinite noun which serves as the predicate of {{m|ca|ésser}}, {{m|ca|esdevenir}}, {{m|ca|estar}} or {{m|ca|semblar}}}}

====Usage notes====
* '''Ho''' cannot be used with either {{m|ca|en}} or {{m|ca|hi}}.
* {{U:ca:pronouns|form=reinforced}}
*: {{uxi|ca|'''Ho''' sabem.|We know '''that'''.}}
* {{U:ca:pronouns|form=full}}
*: {{uxi|ca|Puc fer-'''ho'''.|I can do '''it'''.}}
