Page 15836 l': -------- begin text --------

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|ca|/l-/}}
** {{a|Central|Balearic}} {{IPA|ca|[ɫ-]}}

===Article===
{{head|ca|article|g=mf}}

# {{contraction of|ca|el|nodot=1}}: [[the]]
# {{contraction of|ca|la|nodot=1}}: the

====Usage notes====
* {{m|ca|el}} is contracted to '''''l'''''' before a vowel or ''h-''.
*: {{uxi|ca|'''l<nowiki/>''''avi|the grandfather}}
* {{m|ca|la}} is contracted to '''''l'''''' before a vowel or ''h-'', except before a following unstressed ''(h)i-'' or ''(h)u-''.
*: {{uxi|ca|'''l<nowiki/>''''àvia|the grandmother}}
*: {{uxi|ca|'''l<nowiki/>''''hora|the hour}}
*: {{uxi|ca|'''l<nowiki/>''''única filla|the only daughter|q=stressed ⟨u⟩}}
*: {{uxi|ca|'''la''' ullada|the glance|q=unstressed ⟨u⟩}}

===Pronoun===
{{ca-ppron}}

# {{contraction of|ca|el}}
# {{contraction of|ca|la}}

====Usage notes====
* {{U:ca:pronouns|form=elided}} The exceptions regarding the contraction of {{m|ca|la}} mentioned above apply as well.
*: {{uxi|ca|'''L<nowiki/>''''envejo.|I envy him/her.}}
*: {{uxi|ca|'''La''' interessa.|q=unstressed ⟨i⟩|It interests her.}}

====Declension====
{{ca-decl-ppron}}

