Page 17028 manès: Found match for regex: =
Page 17028 manès: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology===
From {{suffix|ca|Man|ès|gloss1=Isle of Man}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ca-IPA}}

===Adjective===
{{ca-adj}}

# {{lb|ca|colloquial}} {{alternative form of|ca|manx}}

====Usage notes====
The {{m|ca|IEC}} and the {{m|ca|AVL}} disagree over which term to use. Instead of {{m|ca|manx}}, the AVL calls for the use of {{m|ca|manés}} in Valencian. The Central Catalan equivalent, {{m|ca||manès}}, is not recognized by the IEC but is in use.

===Noun===
{{ca-noun|m|f=+}}

# {{lb|ca|colloquial}} {{alternative form of|ca|manx}}

====Usage notes====
The {{m|ca|IEC}} does not recognize a standard Catalan term for a Manxman, but the {{m|ca|AVL}} considers the use of {{m|ca|manés}} to be standard in Valencian.

===Proper noun===
{{ca-proper noun|m}}

# {{lb|ca|colloquial}} {{alternative form of|ca|manx}}

====Usage notes====
The {{m|ca|IEC}} and the {{m|ca|AVL}} disagree over which term to use. Instead of {{m|ca|manx}}, the AVL calls for the use of {{m|ca|manés}} in Valencian. The Central Catalan equivalent, {{m|ca||manès}}, is not recognized by the IEC but is in use.
-------- end text --------
