Page 17031 maneta: Found match for regex: [
Page 17031 maneta: -------- begin text --------
[[File:Palmatum.jpg|thumb|'''maneta''' ''[[Alcyonium palmatum]]'']]

===Etymology===
From {{m|ca|mà||hand}} + {{m|ca|-eta|}} (diminutive).

===Pronunciation===
* {{ca-IPA}}

===Noun===
{{ca-noun|f}}

# {{lb|ca|technology}} [[handle]] of a machine or tool used to apply a rotational force, such as the handle of an oar or a screwdriver
# {{lb|ca|technology}} [[crank]]; a bent piece of an axle, or shaft, or an arm attached at right angles to the end of a shaft or wheel
# [[pestle]]
# [[clock]] [[hand]]
# [[fingerless]] [[glove]]; specifically one worn to avoid the effects of friction on the hand when using a rope
# {{lb|ca|mycology|usually|in the plural}} a [[mushroom]] or cluster of mushrooms with fruiting bodies resembling the fingers of the hand; specifically:
## a cluster of [[agaric]] [[mushrooms]] before the fruiting bodies open to reveal the gills
## mushroom of the genus {{taxlink|Ramaria|genus|noshow=1|ver=161023}}
# {{lb|ca|zoology}} ''[[Alcyonium palmatum]]''; a [[soft coral]] named for protrusions that resemble fingers
# {{lb|ca|zoology|Valencian}} [[forelimb]] of a quadruped

====Synonyms====
* {{sense|mushroom of the genus ''[[Sparassis]]''}} {{l|ca|manetes arrissades}}
* {{sense|mushroom of the genus {{taxlink|Ramaria|genus|noshow=1|ver=161023}}}} {{l|ca|peu de rata}}

====Hypernyms====
* {{sense|mushroom}} {{l|ca|bolet}}

====Derived terms====
* {{l|ca|piano de maneta}} ([[barrel organ]])

===Further reading===
* {{R:ca:IEC2}}

{{C|ca|Clothing|Cnidarians|Mushrooms}}

