=====Usage notes=====
This form is an optional reduced form of the imperative {{m-lite|ca|mira}} that can see use when combined with one or more clitic pronouns attached to the end of the verb - for example:
* {{m-lite|ca||mi-}}{{m-lite|ca|te}}{{m-lite|ca|'l||look at it, look at him}} for {{m-lite|ca||mira-}}{{m-lite|ca|te}}{{m-lite|ca|'l}}

