===Etymology 2===
{{inh+|ca|roa-oca|moyl}}, from {{inh|ca|VL.|*medullum}}, analogically derived from {{inh|ca|la|medulla}}<ref>{{R:ca:GDLC}}</ref>, and probably influenced by Etymology 1. Compare {{cog|oc|mesolh}}, {{cog|es|meollo}}, {{cog|pt|miolo}}. {{doublet|ca|molla|medul·la}}, which were, respectively, inherited and borrowed from Latin.

====Noun====
{{ca-noun|m|-}}

