# {{lb|ca|Balearics|dated}} {{form of|ca|Dialectal form|papallona|gloss=butterfly}}

====Usage notes====
This form, which is the original masculine form of the now feminine {{m|ca|papallona}}, is today retained mainly in the more conservative dialects of [[Catalan]], where it prevails the pronunciation with historical {{m|ca|ieisme}} so that it is sometimes respelled as {{m|ca|papaió}}.

