===Etymology===
From {{der|ca|la|pareo|parēre}}. Displaced as a verb by the doublet {{doublet|ca|parèixer|t1=to seem|notext=1}}; compare {{cog|es|parecer||to seem; opinion}}. Also compare {{cog|fur|parè}}, {{cog|it|parere}}, {{cog|ro|părere}}.

