#: {{syn|ca|esdevenir}}
#* {{quote-journal|ca|journal=Ara|title=Necessito abraçades i petons|trans-title=I need hugs and kisses|date=Feb 10 2020|author=Daniel Bonaventura|passage=Amb el confinament feia mesos que no podia visitar-la i tinc por de '''passar''' a ser un desconegut per a la meva pròpia mare.|t=With the lockdown, it's been months since I've been able to visit her and I'm afraid of '''becoming''' a stranger to my own mother
|url=https://www.ara.cat/comarquesgironines/necessito-abracades-petons_1_3869079.html}}
# {{lb|ca|intransitive}} to [[pass]], to [[go past]], to go beyond
# {{lb|ca|transitive}} to [[pass]], to [[pass through]] {{gloss|to go past, by, over, or through}}
#: {{syn|ca|travessar}}
# {{lb|ca|transitive}} to [[spend]] {{gloss|to use up time}}
# {{lb|ca|transitive}} to [[experience]]; to [[suffer]]
#: {{uxi|ca|'''passar''' fred|to be cold}}
# {{lb|ca|transitive}} to [[pass]], to [[surpass]], to [[exceed]]
#: {{syn|ca|ultrapassar}}
# {{lb|ca|transitive|intransitive|sports}} to [[pass]] {{gloss|to move (the ball or puck) to a teammate}}
# {{lb|ca|intransitive}} to [[pass]] {{gloss|in turn-based games, to decline to play in one's turn}}
# {{lb|ca|intransitive}} to [[pass]] {{gloss|to decline something that is offered or available}}
# {{lb|ca|reflexive}} to [[go bad]], to [[spoil]]
#: {{uxi|ca|Les pomes s'han '''passat'''.}}

