Page 22626 quinzena: Found match for regex: {
Page 22626 quinzena: -------- begin text --------
{{wikipedia|lang=ca|Quinzena|Quinzena (time)}}

===Etymology===
From {{m|ca|quinze||fifteen}} + {{m|ca|-ena||feminine ordinal suffix}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ca-IPA|ê}}

===Adjective===
{{head|ca|adjective form}}

# {{feminine singular of|ca|quinzè}}

===Noun===
{{ca-noun|f}}

# a set of [[fifteen]] like objects
# a period of fifteen consecutive days
# [[fortnight]]

===Usage notes===
While the literal meaning of '''quinzena''' as a period of time is fifteen days, it is also used to describe just two weeks with 14 days or the period from the 16th day of a month to the last day of the month, which can be from 13 to 16 days long.

{{C|ca|Time}}

-------- end text --------
