|passage=Aquesta festa, de fet, no comporta un qüestionament dels rols socials, no està lligada al lloc i no té res a transmetre, s'exhaureix completament en la '''rauxa''' del present {{...}}<br>This festival, in fact, does not involve questioning of social roles, is not tied to the place and has nothing to transmit, is completely exhausted in the '''frenzied action''' of the present {{...}}}}

