Page 24225 salat: -------- begin text --------

===Pronunciation===
* {{ca-IPA}}
* {{rhymes|ca|at|s=2}}

===Etymology 1===
{{wikipedia|lang=ca|Català salat}}
So called because the people are said to use {{m-self|ca|sa}} instead of {{m|ca|la}}. The resemblance with the past participle of {{l|ca|salar|gloss=to salt}} is coincidental.

====Adjective====
{{ca-adj}}

# {{n-g|the use of articles with ''s'' in certain Catalan dialects, as opposed to the usual ones with ''l''; these articles descend from Latin {{m|la|ipse}} and its forms, rather than {{m|la|ille}}, from which the articles in other Catalan dialects and Romance languages descended}}
#: {{l|ca|el}} → {{l|ca|es}}, {{l|ca|so}}
#: {{l|ca|la}} → {{l|ca|sa}}
#: {{l|ca|l'}} → {{l|ca|s'}}
#: {{l|ca|els}} → {{l|ca|es}}, {{l|ca|sos}}
#: {{l|ca|les}} → {{l|ca|ses}}

=====Derived terms=====
{{der3
|ca|article salat
|català salat
|parlar salat
|salar
}}

===Etymology 2===
