=====Derived terms=====
* {{l|ca|salat blanc||Mediterranean saltbush {{taxlink|Atriplex halimus|species}}}}
* {{l|ca|salat ver||shrubby sea-blite {{taxlink|Suaeda vera|species}}}}

====Participle====
{{ca-pp}}

# {{past participle of|ca|salar}}

===Etymology 3===
{{bor+|ca|ar|صلاة|tr=ṣalāt}}.

====Noun====
{{ca-noun|m}}

# {{l|en|salat}} {{gloss|obligatory daily prayer in Islam}}

