===Etymology 4===
From {{inh-lite|ca|la|sibi|sĭbī}}.

====Pronoun====
{{ca-ppron}}

# [[himself]], [[herself]], [[itself]]
# [[oneself]]
# [[themselves]]
# [[each other]]

=====Usage notes=====
* {{m-lite|ca||Si}} is the stressed (or "strong", or "tonic") form of the reflexive pronoun {{m-lite|ca|es}}. As such, it is used after prepositions.

