Page 24929 sí: Found match for regex: =
Page 24929 sí: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology===
{{inh+|ca|la|sīc}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ca-IPA}}
* {{audio|ca|LL-Q7026 (cat)-Unjoanqualsevol-sí.wav|Audio}}
* {{rhymes|ca|i|s=1}}
* {{homophones|ca|si}}

===Particle===
{{head|ca|particle}}

# [[yes]] (affirmation; commonly used to respond affirmatively to a question)
#: {{syn|ca|hoc}}

===Adverb===
{{ca-adv}}

# {{non-gloss definition|the opposite of '[[not]]'}}
#: {{ux|ca|No parles català? – '''Sí''' parlo català!|Do you not speak Catalan? – I '''do''' speak Catalan!}}
#: {{syn|ca|hoc}}

====Usage notes====
* ''Sí'' is used to add positive emphasis to the verb, much like the auxiliary {{m|en|do}} in affirmative sentences in English. It generally contrasts with a previous {{m|ca|no}}, and is placed in the same location within the sentence. This is a usage the word shares with Spanish.

====Antonyms====
* {{l|ca|no}}

====See also====
* {{l|ca|si}}

===Further reading===
* {{R:ca:DCVB}}
* {{R:ca:GDLC}}
* {{R:ca:IEC2}}

-------- end text --------
