{{inh+|ca|roa-oca|verí}}~{{m|roa-oca|verin}}, from {{inh|ca|VL.||*venīnum}} (with dissimilation of the first /n/), alteration of {{inh|ca|la|venēnum||poison}}, from {{inh|ca|itc-pro|*weneznom||lust, desire}}, from {{der|ca|ine-pro|*wenh₁-||to strive, wish, love}}. Compare {{cog|oc|verin}}, {{cog|fr|venin}}.

===Pronunciation===
