Page 28716 ¡ !: -------- begin text --------

===Punctuation mark===
{{head|ca|punctuation mark|head=[[¡]] [[!]]|cat2=matched pairs}}

# {{n-g|occasionally encloses an [[exclamation]] in modern Catalan; at other times, a lone exclamation mark is used at the end with nothing at the beginning of the exclamatory phrase}}
#: {{ux|ca|'''¡'''Ditxós qui sab estimarla'''! ¡'''Benhaurat aquell en quin cor brilla encesa la vivificant y pura flama de la fé'''!'''|Lucky is he who can love her! Blessed is he in whose heart there shines the life-giving and pure flame of faith!}}

====Usage notes====
'''¡''' is used at the beginning of a phrase expressing [[exclamation]], with '''!''' at the end; however, in Catalan it is not mandatory to use ''¡''.

====See also====
* {{l|ca|¿ ?}}
* {{l|ca|?}}

-------- end text --------
