{{diacritic|ca|·}}

# [[middot]], [[middle dot]] {{gloss|a [[diacritical mark]] of the [[Appendix:Latin script|Latin script]], called {{m|ca|punt volat||flown dot}} in Catalan, and found in the combination '''{{l|ca|l·l}}''' to distinguish it from the digraph '''{{l|ca|ll}}'''}}

